sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Adviser
  participant C as Clients tab (LWC)
  participant H as Create Illustration tab (LWC host)
  participant W as WaveMaker app (iframe, salesforce.app)
  participant X as Apex + Named Credential
  participant API as Illustration API
  participant L as Illustrations tab (LWC)

  A->>C: Open Clients
  C->>X: getClients()
  X->>API: GET /clients?adviserId=1
  API-->>C: clients
  A->>C: Create Illustration → choose parties → Start illustration
  C->>H: navigate (c__employeeId, parties)
  H->>W: load UI Bundle in sandboxed iframe
  W-->>H: sf-embedding/ready (handshake)
  H-->>W: MessagePort + props (selected client as JSON)
  W->>W: selectedEmployee variable ← client
  A->>W: complete the illustration journey and submit
  W->>API: POST /illustrations
  W->>H: event navigatetab (illustrationClientList)
  H->>L: open tab with c__refresh
  L->>X: refresh getIllustrations()
  X->>API: GET /illustrations
  API-->>L: illustrations (new one included)
  A->>L: Download PDF / XML
  L->>X: getIllustrationPdf / getIllustrationXml
  X->>API: GET /{id}/generate-pdf · /{id}/txlife/download
  X-->>L: file (base64) → browser download
